    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p style="text-align: left;">We are ready to provide you with advice or a quote.<br /><strong>Send us an enquiry <a href="/head-office/#reachout" title="Head Office" data-anchor="#reachout">here</a></strong><span> or call </span><strong>066 299 1985.</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">These technologies allow us to conduct integrity and durability testing and produce detailed 3D interpretations of concrete structures without sampling or destruction. </p>]]></Value>
