    "categoryNumber": "05",
    "categoryHeading1": "Pull-off Testing Screed, Epoxy and Coatings",
    "category": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span>Evaluate the pull-off</span><span> strength (adhesion) of a </span>coating <span>from a rigid substrate such as a concrete or metal floor.</span></p>",
