    "categoryNumber": "06",
    "categoryHeading1": "Pull-out Testing Chemical Anchors, Fixings",
    "category": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">A test rig is attached to a bolt, screw, anchor or fixing and put under tension to the designed stress load level to determine how strong and secure the fixing is.</p>",
    "categoryImage": "umb://media/ebf31ad488f54e1f99dd488207ed205f"
